          "name": "Get Payer Record",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Payer Record",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieve a single payer record by its Stedi payer ID.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "payer",
                ":stediId"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "stediId",
                  "description": "(Required) The Stedi payer ID, a unique identifier Stedi assigns to each payer that will never change. You can find the Stedi payer ID for any supported payer in the [Payer Network](https://www.stedi.com/healthcare/network).\n\nThis must be the Stedi payer ID - querying with the primary payer ID or payer ID aliases isn't supported."
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
